#. comic340 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:48
msgctxt "comic340#title.1"
msgid "\"WHO CAN IT BE NOW\""
msgstr ""

#. comic340 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:85
msgctxt "comic340#p1.1"
msgid "Scene change to... Mod HQ?"
msgstr ""

#. comic340 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:91
msgctxt "comic340#p1.2"
msgid "Hopetown Constitution: Abolished."
msgstr ""

#. comic340 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:147
msgctxt "comic340#p2.1"
msgid "Political rivals: Eliminated.<br>Pleasantly evil new decor: Installed."
msgstr ""

#. comic340 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought.gif, crystaldesk.gif
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:200
msgctxt "comic340#p3.1"
msgid "I control this server and many others. I am currently the most powerful authority in the cyberworld. And yet I cannot rest, knowing that none of it is permanent..."
msgstr ""

#. comic340 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystaldesk3.gif
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:251
msgctxt "comic340#p4.1"
msgid "No, my kingdom can never be guaranteed to last until I have reached Chimera Point, and until Radd is dead. The first task is inevitable, but the second, ergh, will it forever elude me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic340 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: crystaldesk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:302
msgctxt "comic340#p5.1"
msgid "Excuse me..."
msgstr ""

#. comic340 panel p6
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gnarlshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic340.htm:352
msgctxt "comic340#p6.1"
msgid "...Perhaps <b>I</b> can help."
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:42
msgctxt "comic341#title.1"
msgid "\"IF SHE KNEW WHAT SHE WANTS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:83
msgctxt "comic341#p1.1"
msgid "How the hell did you get in here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:87
msgctxt "comic341#p1.2"
msgid "In a word: Skill. In two words: Wicked skill."
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystaldmad.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:139
msgctxt "comic341#p2.1"
msgid "Don't trifle with me. Now what do you want?"
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystaldmad.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:143
msgctxt "comic341#p2.2"
msgid "Why, only the same thing you do."
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:191
msgctxt "comic341#p3.1"
msgid "Ultimate power?"
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:195
msgctxt "comic341#p3.2"
msgid "No, <b>Radd.</b> And if you help me, I can find him."
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystaldsh.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:243
msgctxt "comic341#p4.1"
msgid "Errrrgh....<br>Continue."
msgstr ""

#. comic341 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystaldsh.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic341.htm:247
msgctxt "comic341#p4.2"
msgid "Hey, you're <b>cute</b> when you're struggling to restrain homicidal rage."
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:39
msgctxt "comic342#title.1"
msgid "\"FALSE DESTINY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:80
msgctxt "comic342#p1.1"
msgid "I remember you. Aren't you?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:84
msgctxt "comic342#p1.2"
msgid "Gnarl. Radd's <i>brother</i>."
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystalsit.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:140
msgctxt "comic342#p2.1"
msgid "\"Brother,\" sheesh. Like so many other sprites, you still believe the roles assigned to you by your game's makers. Repulsive."
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystaltable.gif, gnarltableh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:186
msgctxt "comic342#p3.1"
msgid "Well I've got news for you: That was just a story. You're not really his \"brother,\" any more than Sheena's really his \"girlfriend.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystaltable.gif, gnarltableh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:190
msgctxt "comic342#p3.2"
msgid "Point taken. But I don't find living in the past quite so bad."
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: cheadmad.gif, ampstand.gif, juliefglad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:240
msgctxt "comic342#p4.1"
msgid "Well, I do! It disgusts me to see sprites who can't handle reality. Like that Amp traitor who used to work here, always playing with his \"daughter.\" Those idiots never quite got it through their heads that they're the <i>same age,</i> for crying out loud!"
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlstare2.gif, crystaldeskl.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:292
msgctxt "comic342#p5.1"
msgid "You didn't like your role in your game much, I take it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic342 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlstare2.gif, crystaldeskl.gif
#: kidradd/comic342.htm:296
msgctxt "comic342#p5.2"
msgid "Random monster in a crappy RPG. I'm sure not gonna live out my life playing <i>that</i> part."
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:39
msgctxt "comic343#title.1"
msgid "\"FEEL IT COMING\""
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystalfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:84
msgctxt "comic343#p1.1"
msgid "Listen buddy, I've already got hoards of subordinates searching for Radd and his misfit friends, with no luck so far."
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p1
#. slot: imsert images on this line
#. images: crystalfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:91
msgctxt "comic343#p1.2"
msgid "Crystal sure hates lighting. Vampire fairy or something?"
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlpose2.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:136
msgctxt "comic343#p2.1"
msgid "So answer my question. How can <b>you</b> find Radd?"
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlpose2.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:140
msgctxt "comic343#p2.2"
msgid "Well, it's a curious power I've got..."
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: gnarlblink2.gif, sheenastare.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:183
msgctxt "comic343#p3.1"
msgid "\"Back when I was a boss, I always knew where Radd was. Standing in my one-room haven, I couldn't see the outside world, but could sense when Radd was approaching.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: even2.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:237
msgctxt "comic343#p4.1"
msgid "\"I knew when Radd was on my level; When he would enter the room, where to fire my shots without looking. I could just sense his coordinates. It was a simple, yet necessary skill for being a boss character.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlfist2.gif, cmallet.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:296
msgctxt "comic343#p5.1"
msgid "How ironic then, that this power of mine seems stronger <b>outside</b> of the game."
msgstr ""

#. comic343 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlfist2.gif, cmallet.gif
#: kidradd/comic343.htm:300
msgctxt "comic343#p5.2"
msgid "Yeah, much stronger. Have some more irony..."
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:48
msgctxt "comic344#title.1"
msgid "\"CHANCES ARE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:89
msgctxt "comic344#p1.1"
msgid "<b>Ow!</b> Whadja do that for?"
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:93
msgctxt "comic344#p1.2"
msgid "You said you could sense danger. Experiment: failed."
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gcrystal.gif
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:144
msgctxt "comic344#p2.1"
msgid "Not danger! Just <b>Radd.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gcrystal.gif
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:148
msgctxt "comic344#p2.2"
msgid "Are you saying you can tell where Radd is <i>right now?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:195
msgctxt "comic344#p3.1"
msgid "Not quite. But if I'm in the same computer as him, I'll know it."
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:199
msgctxt "comic344#p3.2"
msgid "There's a <i>lot</i> of computers on the web. Needle, haystack."
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gnarlfists.gif
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:250
msgctxt "comic344#p5.1"
msgid "Perhaps, but I can skip between dozens of servers a day, just quick \"peeks\" to see if Radd's there. Given enough time, eventually I'll get lucky."
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarltablew.gif, crystaltable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:299
msgctxt "comic344#p6.1"
msgid "Speaking of which, are you free for dinner sometime?"
msgstr ""

#. comic344 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarltablew.gif, crystaltable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic344.htm:303
msgctxt "comic344#p6.2"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:53
msgctxt "comic345#title.1"
msgid "\"CONDITIONS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlfist2.gif
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:94
msgctxt "comic345#p1.1"
msgid "Well, what you say does bear some merit. What do you require?"
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlfist2.gif
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:98
msgctxt "comic345#p1.2"
msgid "Just a ship to travel between servers. A fast one, preferably."
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystalblink.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:150
msgctxt "comic345#p2.1"
msgid "Very well. Though it pains me, I just may accept your offer."
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystalblink.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:154
msgctxt "comic345#p2.2"
msgid "Awesome! You won't regret it."
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:204
msgctxt "comic345#p3.1"
msgid "But <b>first</b>... I've got to test your mettle. Besides, I can't let you go unpunished for barging in here uninvited."
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:215
msgctxt "comic345#p3.2"
msgid "She's scaaaaarry..."
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarledge.gif, crystalmad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:254
msgctxt "comic345#p4.1"
msgid "Hey now, you wouldn't actually hurt your new business partner, right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic345 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarledge.gif, crystalmad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic345.htm:258
msgctxt "comic345#p4.2"
msgid "That depends how much \"wicked skill\" you truly have."
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:53
msgctxt "comic346#title.1"
msgid "\"SPIN ME RIGHT ROUND\""
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarledge.gif, crystalmad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:94
msgctxt "comic346#p1.1"
msgid "Easy there, can't we be civilized about this?"
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarledge.gif, crystalmad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:98
msgctxt "comic346#p1.2"
msgid "Let me think about that -- <b>No.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlpose.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:150
msgctxt "comic346#p2.1"
msgid "I mean, at least let us start simultaneously. You know, like in a duel or something."
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlpose.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:154
msgctxt "comic346#p2.2"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:202
msgctxt "comic346#p3.1"
msgid "Ready when you are."
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:206
msgctxt "comic346#p3.2"
msgid "Let's do this."
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:215
msgctxt "comic346#p3.3"
msgid "What is this, my fifth Matrix reference by now? Sheesh."
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarldizz.gif, crystalfront2.gif
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:254
msgctxt "comic346#p4.1"
msgid "Whoa. Bullet time always makes me dizzy."
msgstr ""

#. comic346 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarldizz.gif, crystalfront2.gif
#: kidradd/comic346.htm:258
msgctxt "comic346#p4.2"
msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. comic347 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic347.htm:52
msgctxt "comic347#title.1"
msgid "\"DON'T GO THERE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic347 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gnarldodge.gif
#: kidradd/comic347.htm:95
msgctxt "comic347#p1.1"
msgid "Well, at very least you're good at dodging..."
msgstr ""

#. comic347 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: crystaldodge.gif
#: kidradd/comic347.htm:151
msgctxt "comic347#p2.1"
msgid "...Though your aim could use a little work."
msgstr ""

#. comic347 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic347.htm:202
msgctxt "comic347#p3.1"
msgid "Alright, I see I'll hafta get serious.<br><b>Transform: Gnarlborg 2000!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic347 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic347.htm:213
msgctxt "comic347#p3.2"
msgid "Any cheesiness is purely intentional."
msgstr ""

#. comic347 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlbotm.gif
#: kidradd/comic347.htm:305
msgctxt "comic347#p5.1"
msgid "You know you have no..."
msgstr ""

#. comic347 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlbotm.gif
#: kidradd/comic347.htm:309
msgctxt "comic347#p5.2"
msgid "I <b>know!!!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:58
msgctxt "comic348#title.1"
msgid "\"BABY STEPS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:101
msgctxt "comic348#p1.1"
msgid "Don't cry to me if you get hurt Crystal, cuz you're getting the full blast!"
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel p1
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:112
msgctxt "comic348#p1.2"
msgid "Way too Freudian."
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:156
msgctxt "comic348#p2.1"
msgid "Well now! Your attack power has certainly become more impressive!"
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlbot2.gif
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:205
msgctxt "comic348#p3.1"
msgid "But you seem to be staying in one place. Can't you move at all?"
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: fairy.gif, gnarlbot2.gif
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:209
msgctxt "comic348#p3.2"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystalha.gif, gnarlbotm.gif
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:309
msgctxt "comic348#p6.1"
msgid "Now <b>that's</b> a capable evasion!"
msgstr ""

#. comic348 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystalha.gif, gnarlbotm.gif
#: kidradd/comic348.htm:313
msgctxt "comic348#p6.2"
msgid "Oh, shut up."
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:39
msgctxt "comic349#title.1"
msgid "\"EMPTY PROMISES\""
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:80
msgctxt "comic349#p1.1"
msgid "Alright, despite certain, ahem, \"shortcomings\" you've managed to show some skill. You'll get your ship."
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:84
msgctxt "comic349#p1.2"
msgid "Radical!"
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlyeah2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:136
msgctxt "comic349#p2.1"
msgid "But only on the condition that you'll merely inform us when you find Radd, so I can handle him."
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlyeah2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:140
msgctxt "comic349#p2.2"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlyeah2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:188
msgctxt "comic349#p3.1"
msgid "I repeat, under no conditions are you to actually engage Radd in battle, got it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlyeah2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:192
msgctxt "comic349#p3.2"
msgid "Got it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: crystald.gif, gnarlyeah2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:242
msgctxt "comic349#p4.1"
msgid "This is what's known as a pregnant pause."
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystaldargh.gif, gnarlyeah2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:293
msgctxt "comic349#p5.1"
msgid "Just go before I change my mind, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. comic349 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystaldargh.gif, gnarlyeah2.gif
#: kidradd/comic349.htm:297
msgctxt "comic349#p5.2"
msgid "Gladly!"
msgstr ""

#. comic350 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic350.htm:52
msgctxt "comic350#title.1"
msgid "\"'TIL NEXT TIME\""
msgstr ""

#. comic350 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought.gif, crystald.gif, gnarlyeah.gif
#: kidradd/comic350.htm:97
msgctxt "comic350#p1.1"
msgid "Well, at very least the fool can't hurt my search for Radd. Much."
msgstr ""

#. comic350 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought.gif, crystaldeskb.gif
#: kidradd/comic350.htm:153
msgctxt "comic350#p2.1"
msgid "Hmph, he never even told me <i>why</i> he was so eager to find his \"brother.\" Not that I need to ask."
msgstr ""

#. comic350 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought.gif, crystaldesk.gif
#: kidradd/comic350.htm:205
msgctxt "comic350#p3.1"
msgid "I know his type only too well. Forever bound to their programming, until the day it kills them."
msgstr ""

#. comic350 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought.gif, crystaldesk3.gif
#: kidradd/comic350.htm:256
msgctxt "comic350#p4.1"
msgid "But who knows, maybe he'll get what he wants, and save me the trouble..."
msgstr ""

#. comic351 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic351.htm:39
msgctxt "comic351#title.1"
msgid "\"HARD FOR ME TO SAY I'M SORRY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic351 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddblink.gif, sheenaleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic351.htm:80
msgctxt "comic351#p1.1"
msgid "Time to take on another game."
msgstr ""

#. comic351 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddblink.gif, sheenaleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic351.htm:84
msgctxt "comic351#p1.2"
msgid "Ahem."
msgstr ""

#. comic351 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeysad.gif, raddstand2.gif, sheenablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic351.htm:136
msgctxt "comic351#p2.1"
msgid "Oh, right. Uh Bogey, we just want you to know that we consider you a very dedicated and <b>useful</b> member of our team."
msgstr ""

#. comic351 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddstand2.gif, sheenastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic351.htm:187
msgctxt "comic351#p3.1"
msgid "Just because we aren't taking you to the games anymore is in no way meant to imply that you're <b>useless</b> or anything."
msgstr ""

#. comic351 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeymad.gif, raddscratch2.gif, sheenamad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic351.htm:239
msgctxt "comic351#p4.1"
msgid "In fact, I'm sure that you'll continue to make worthy contributions to our efforts, like that time when you... uh... or when you... well, I'm sure you've done <b>something.</b> Probably."
msgstr ""

#. comic351 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
